  "content": "<center>\n\t<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/cobblebuilds-leaders\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://shieldcn.dev/badge/Available%20on-Modrinth.svg?variant=outline&color=1BD96A&valueColor=1BD96A&gradient=%20%201BD96A20%2C+%20%201BD96A20&logo=modrinth&logoColor=1BD96A\" alt=\"徽章：於 Modrinth 上可用\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/cobblebuilds-leaders\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://shieldcn.dev/badge/Available%20on-CurseForge.svg?variant=outline&color=F16436&valueColor=F16436&gradient=%20%20F1643620%2C+%20%20F1643620&logo=curseforge&logoColor=F16436\" alt=\"徽章：於 CurseForge 上可用\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://discord.gg/7T8UEBrHcf\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://shieldcn.dev/badge/Chat%20with%20us%20on-Discord.svg?variant=outline&color=5865F2&valueColor=5865F2&gradient=%20%205865F220%2C+%20%205865F220&logo=discord&logoColor=5865F2\" alt=\"徽章：在 Discord 上與我們聊聊天\">\n\t</a>\n</center>\n<p></p>\n<center>\n\t<img src=\"https://shieldcn.dev/badge/Available%20in-English.svg?logo=🇺🇸&variant=outline&size=xs\" alt=\"徽章：提供英文版\">\n\t<img src=\"https://shieldcn.dev/badge/Disponível%20em-Português.svg?logo=🇧🇷&variant=outline&size=xs\" alt=\"徽章：提供葡萄牙文版\">\n</center>\n<p></p>\n\nCobbleBuilds：領主是 [Cobblemon](https://modrinth.com/project/MdwFAVRL) 的一款附加元件，讓你可以尋找**道館**、擊敗**道館館主**、並獲得**道館徽章**，成為最強的訓練家。\n<p></p>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png\"></center><p></p>\n\n<center>\n\t<iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ujK1VtT2Lyo\" title=\"Cobblebuilds：領主預告片\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer;autoplay;clipboard-write;encrypted-media;gyroscope;picture-in-picture;web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</center>\n<p></p>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png\"></center><p></p>\n\n<center><font size=\"5\"><strong>請注意</strong></font></center><p></p>\n\n**此專案仍處於 Alpha 階段。所有內容皆可能變動，過程中可能導致東西損壞。**\n**更新資料包前請務必備份您的世界，以確保必要時可以還原變更。**\n\n<center><font size=\"4\"><strong>另外請注意</strong></font></center><p></p>\n\n更新時，如果**次要**或**主要**版本變更，您**可能會失去部分進度**。\n\n<center>\n\t<table style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<th>安全</th>\n\t\t\t<th colspan=\"2\">不保證</th>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td><b>0.0.0</b> → <b>0.0.1</b></td>\n\t\t\t<td><b>0.0.1</b> → <b>0.1.0</b></td>\n\t\t\t<td><b>0.1.0</b> → <b>1.0.0</b></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</table>\n</center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png\"></center><p></p>\n\n<center><font size=\"5\"><strong>遊戲玩法</strong></font></center><p></p>\n\n在探索世界時，你可能會遇到由**道館訓練家**駐守的**道館**。\n你可以擊敗這些**道館訓練家**來提升你的**訓練家等級**。\n\n隨著你的**訓練家等級**提升，不同的**道館訓練家**將會出現，他們的**寶可夢隊伍**的難度也會隨之調整。\n當你達到特定的**訓練家等級**時，四位**道館館主**之一將會出現。\n\n每位**道館館主**在首次擊敗時會授予**道館徽章**。這些徽章分為**四個等級**，依序授予：**銅徽章**、**金徽章**、**鑽石徽章**與**獄髓徽章**。\n\n你可以透過**進度畫面**中的 **CobbleBuilds 訓練家卡片** 分頁來查看你目前的**道館徽章**與**訓練家等級**。\n\n<center><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png\"></center><p></p>\n\n<center><font size=\"5\"><strong>目前的道館與館主</strong></font></center><p></p>\n\n此資料包目前包含 **12 座道館**與 **48 位道館館主**。\n\n<center>\n\t<details>\n\t\t<summary>點擊顯示完整列表</summary>\n\t\t<table style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<th colspan=\"5\">0.0.0︱初始版本</th>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<th>電</th>\n\t\t\t\t<td>希特隆</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>小菊兒</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>馬志士</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>鐵旋</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<th>火</th>\n\t\t\t\t<td>夏伯</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>伯特</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>亞莎</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>卡蕪</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<th>草</th>\n\t\t\t\t<td>寇沙</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>天桐</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>莉佳</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>菜種</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<th>毒</th>\n\t\t\t\t<td>阿杏</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>克拉拉</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>阿桔</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>霍米加</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<th>岩石</th>\n\t\t\t\t<td>小剛</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>亞洛</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>瓢太</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>杜娟</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<th>水</th>\n\t\t\t\t<td>吉憲</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>克莉絲</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>小霞</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>米可利</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<th colspan=\"5\">0.1.0︱神奧－城都道館更新</th>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<th>蟲</th>\n\t\t\t\t<td>阿筆</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>亞堤</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>圓模</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>紫羅蘭</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<th>格鬥</th>\n\t\t\t\t<td>藤樹</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>阿四</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>可爾妮</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>李柯</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<th>幽靈</th>\n\t\t\t\t<td>歐尼奧</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>梅麗莎</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>小松</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>萊姆</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<th>冰</th>\n\t\t\t\t<td>哈奇庫</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>小菘</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>古魯夏</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>柳伯</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<th>一般</th>\n\t\t\t\t<td>青木</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>蘆筍</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>千里</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>小茜</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<th>鋼</th>\n\t\t\t\t<td>東瓜</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>阿蜜</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>瑪拉柔</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>皮歐尼</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t</table>\n\t</details>\n</center>\n<p></p>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png\"></center><p></p>\n\n<center><font size=\"5\"><strong>附加內容</strong></font></center><p></p>\n\n### [CobbleBuilds：音效](https://github.com/B1BU/CobbleBuilds-Sounds)\n\n一個選用的資源包，為訓練家對戰加入了由 [Zame](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKKKbeAhjKYJfOy5Opg8lcQ) 混音的戰鬥主題曲重混版。\n\n<center><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png\"></center><p></p>\n\n<center><font size=\"5\"><strong>特別感謝</strong></font></center><p></p>\n\n### [Instrafe](https://modrinth.com/user/Instrafe)\n\n他的附加元件 [Cobbled Trainers](https://modrinth.com/datapack/cobblemon-trainers) 在我們專案初期對於理解 Cobblemon NPC 系統非常有幫助。\n\n### [Inazuma](https://modrinth.com/user/GGIIdlEN)\n\n感謝他製作了鋼系道館館主阿蜜的紋理。\n\n<center><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png\"></center><p></p>\n\n[加入我們的 Discord 伺服器](https://discord.gg/7T8UEBrHcf) 以獲取專案的最新消息、排除問題、提交意見回饋，或是單純跟我們說些好話。",
